  <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:0">{{ city.count }} local {{ niche_label|lower }} {{ 'business' if city.count == 1 else 'businesses' }} serving {{ city.place }} — compare and contact them directly.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="dir-sec"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="prov-grid">{% for prov in city.providers %}{{ card(prov) }}{% endfor %}</div>
</div></section>
<section class="dir-sec sec-alt" style="background:var(--surface)"><div class="wrap dir-prose">
  <h2 class="sec-h2">Finding a {{ niche_label|lower }} company in {{ city.city }}</h2>
  <p>Looking for a {{ niche_label|lower }} company in {{ city.place }}? This page lists {{ city.count }} local {{ niche_label|lower }} {{ 'business' if city.count == 1 else 'businesses' }} serving {{ city.city }} and the surrounding area. Each listing shows the company's contact details and the services it covers — and, where available, its rating — so you can line up a few and reach the right one directly.</p>
  <p>Local knowledge matters for {{ niche_label|lower }} work. A company that already covers {{ city.city }} knows the area and the kinds of properties in it, and can usually get to you sooner. Browse the businesses above, compare what each one offers, then call or message them to talk through your job and get a written quote before anything starts. Using {{ dir_title }} is free — you deal with each company directly, with no lead fees.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="dir-sec"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="sec-eyebrow">Before you call</p>
  <h2 class="sec-h2">How to choose a {{ niche_label|lower }} company in {{ city.city }}</h2>
  <div class="how-grid">
    <div class="how-step"><span class="how-n">1</span><h3>Match the service</h3><p>Check the company covers the exact {{ niche_label|lower }} job you need — not every business does everything.</p></div>
    <div class="how-step"><span class="how-n">2</span><h3>Compare ratings</h3><p>Look at ratings and reviews, and how established each business is.</p></div>
    <div class="how-step"><span class="how-n">3</span><h3>Ask for a written quote</h3><p>A written quote before work starts is the best way to avoid surprises.</p></div>
    <div class="how-step"><span class="how-n">4</span><h3>Confirm the details</h3><p>Confirm licensing, insurance and timing directly with the business.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="dir-sec sec-alt" style="background:var(--surface)"><div class="wrap dir-faq">
  <p class="sec-eyebrow">Good to know</p>
  <h2 class="sec-h2">{{ niche_label }} in {{ city.city }} — questions answered</h2>
  {% for f in faqs %}<details{{ ' open' if loop.first }}><summary>{{ f.q }}</summary><p>{{ f.a }}</p></details>{% endfor %}
</div></section>
{% if cities|length > 1 %}
<section class="dir-sec"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="sec-eyebrow">Nearby</p>
  <h2 class="sec-h2">{{ niche_label }} companies in other cities</h2>
  <div class="city-grid">{% for c in cities if c.slug != city.slug %}<a class="city-chip" href="/city/{{ c.slug }}"><span>{{ c.place }}</span><span class="n">{{ c.count }}</span></a>{% endfor %}</div>
</div></section>
{% endif %}

{% elif page == 'provider' %}
<section class="pv-head"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">{{ dir_title }}</a> <span>›</span> {% if prov.place %}<a href="/city/{{ prov.place|slug }}">{{ prov.place }}</a> <span>›</span> {% endif %}<span>{{ prov.name }}</span></p>
  <h1>{{ prov.name }}</h1>
