    <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;margin:.4rem 0 .7rem">About {{ prov.name }}</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--muted)">{{ prov.name }} is a {{ niche_label|lower }} business{% if prov.place %} serving {{ prov.place }} and the surrounding area{% endif %}{% if prov.years %}, with {{ prov.years }} years in business{% endif %}. This page brings together everything you need to get in touch — the phone number{% if prov.email %}, email{% endif %}{% if prov.address_full %}, address{% endif %}{% if prov.hours %} and opening hours{% endif %} — so you can reach them directly.</p>
    <p style="color:var(--muted)">{{ niche_label }} work ranges from small repairs to larger installations, and the right company depends on the job in front of you. Contact {{ prov.name }} to describe what you need, ask any questions and get a written quote before any work begins. There is no fee to use {{ dir_title }} and no middleman — you deal with the business directly.</p>
    {% set plist = prov.services or services %}
    {% if plist %}
    <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;margin:1.6rem 0 .8rem">Services</h2>
    <div class="svc-list">
      {% for s in plist %}<div class="svc-item"><span class="svc-tick" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.2 4.3L19 7"/></svg></span><div><b>{{ s }}</b><span>Ask {{ prov.name }} about {{ s|lower }}{% if prov.place %} in {{ prov.city or prov.place }}{% endif %}.</span></div></div>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem;margin:1.6rem 0 .8rem">Frequently asked questions</h2>
